        "## Exercises"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "1. Add a detector for \"success hallucination\": agent returns success but the target state is unchanged.\n2. Tag 100 real traces from a product you've built. Which mode dominates? What's the cost of fixing it?\n3. Implement a \"cascade radius\" metric: given a failure at step N, how many downstream steps did it affect?\n4. Read MASFT's 14 failure modes. Pick three that apply to your product. Write detectors.\n5. Wire one detector into a CI job: fail the build if >=5% of traces tag a mode."
